  "about": {
    "title": "Good food, good mood",
    "story": [
      "Crosta opened on Circular Road in October, turning a bare construction site into Nabha’s all-day Italian cafe and bakehouse: blistered pizzas, handcrafted pasta bowls, fresh bakes and savoury veg & non-veg snacks, all under one roof.",
      "Come for the food, stay for the room: hand-woven carpets across the ceiling and walls, marble, cane chairs and warm lighting make it the spot for a casual hangout, a date night or a late craving run."
    ],
